!Sample_organism_ch1 = Mus musculus
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 10090
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = tissue: Bone marrow
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = derivation: J2 immortalized and Cas9 Transduced
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = strain: C57BL/6J
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = m_abscessus_intracellularlevels: Mab_High
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = Transduced library was infected with mEmerald M. abscessus for four hours then cells were sorted into infected and uninfected populations
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = Macrophages were grown in DMEM with 10% FBS  for the duration of the experiment
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = genomic DNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Cells were lysed and total genomic DNA was isolated using aluminum acetate purification
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Libraries were constructed using Truseq primers and indexes
!Sample_data_processing = Illumina software was used for Basecalls
!Sample_data_processing = FastQC (v0.11.5) was used to assess the quality of raw data.
!Sample_data_processing = Cutadapt (v2.9) was used to removeadapter sequences
!Sample_data_processing = Assembly: sgRNA counts were determined using MAGeCK "count" function with trimmed FASTq files as input
!Sample_data_processing = significant changes in gene representation were quantified using MAGeCK "test" using the robust rank algorithm
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: Normalized Count table was generated using MAGeCK
